# Mentrixa Premium UI Stack

Read with PROMPT 001 (master + animation context) before any UI work.

## Skill and tool map

| Skill / tool | When to use |
|--------------|-------------|
| **ui-pro-max** | REQUIRED first step: `python .cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py "<query>" --design-system -p Mentrixa`. Apply `design-system/MASTER.md` when brand conflicts. |
| **banner design / brand** | Landing heroes, CTAs, rank reveal. Tokens only. Gold = verified truth. |
| **design-system / design taste-frontend / frontend-design / ui-styling** | Layout, spacing, typography hierarchy, contrast. Follow MASTER + tokens.css. |
| **21st MCP + shadcn** | Net-new structural components only (Card, Dialog, Command, Tooltip, Progress, Badge). Integrate into `@/shared/ui/`. |
| **vercel-react-best-practices** | RSC-first data, SWR cache, thin route shells, no client waterfalls. |
| **GSAP / gsap-master** | Multi-element timelines, landing entry, ScrollTrigger. Import `@/shared/core/gsap` only. |
| **Lenis** | Global smooth scroll via `@/shared/animation/lenis-provider` in root layout. GSAP ticker sync. |
| **anime.js** | Data viz, node bloom, counters, grid stagger. Import `@/shared/animation/anime` only. |
| **motion.dev / motion-framer** | Micro-interactions + AnimatePresence/layout. Import `@/shared/animation/motion` only. |
| **Kokonut UI** | `KokonutGlass` for frosted panels and verified ambient glow. |
| **Bklit UI** | `BklitShimmer` / `BklitShimmerGrid` for all loading states. No spinners. |
| **convex-create-component** | N/A unless Convex surfaces are added. |

## Import policy (no sloppy imports)

```
✅ @/shared/animation/anime
✅ @/shared/animation/motion
✅ @/shared/animation/lenis-provider
✅ @/shared/core/gsap
✅ @/shared/ui/bklit-shimmer
✅ @/shared/ui/kokonut-glass
✅ @/styles/tokens.css (via globals)

❌ animejs, motion/react, framer-motion (direct)
❌ react-spring, lottie-react, aos, @motionone/dom
```

Run `npm run validate:ui-imports` after UI changes.

## Validation gates

```bash
npm run validate:tokens
npm run validate:ui-imports
npm run test:ci
```
